    "description": "<p>[Trigger: Setup] Designate one enemy within 4Sq from you. The target will be unable to use [Causal Power] unless they immediately pay 1 point of [Causal Power]. This effect lasts until the end of the round. 1/Scene&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>A cane carved with a geometric pattern resembling 14 plant leaves. It seems that it was originally a part built into some other large machine, but now it is used as a weapon due to the usefulness of its internal magic circuits. When the circuit is activated, it can transmit a wavelength that obstructs the surrounding magical power.</p>\n<hr>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 185pt;\" border=\"0\" width=\"245\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><colgroup><col style=\"mso-width-source: userset; mso-width-alt: 1792; width: 37pt;\" span=\"5\" width=\"49\"> </colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"mso-height-source: userset; height: 12.75pt;\">\n<td class=\"xl66\" style=\"border-right: .5pt solid black; height: 12.75pt; width: 185pt;\" colspan=\"5\" width=\"245\" height=\"17\">Logic Circuit [Core Material] (60G)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-height-source: userset; height: 12.75pt;\">\n<td class=\"xl66\" style=\"border-right: .5pt solid black; height: 12.75pt;\" colspan=\"5\" height=\"17\">2x Elm Staff (110G)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-height-source: userset; height: 12.75pt;\">\n<td class=\"xl66\" style=\"border-right: .5pt solid black; height: 12.75pt;\" colspan=\"5\" height=\"17\">3x [Magic Catalyst 4] (30G)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-height-source: userset; height: 12.75pt;\">\n<td class=\"xl66\" style=\"border-right: .5pt solid black; height: 12.75pt;\" colspan=\"5\" height=\"17\">-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-height-source: userset; height: 12.75pt;\">\n<td class=\"xl70\" style=\"border-right: .5pt solid black; height: 12.75pt;\" colspan=\"5\" height=\"17\">Construction (140G)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
